    "notes": "expected_delta.json is captured from the pristine app (never hand-written). Table/column names confirmed empirically by diffing a full dump during capture (join tables use tags_id/watchers_id, not Tag_id/Watcher_id). UserSession is deliberately excluded: auth plumbing, volatile by nature \u2014 the independent_frontend gate allows re-implementing it. ignore_columns are stripped from inserted/deleted rows and update comparisons by the capture tooling."
